Add banner functions near showRaceMessage maybe. Need timer variable. Add `let pitCallTimer = 0; let pitCallPersistent = false;` near messageTimer. Functions:
```
function showPitCall(main, sub, { duration=4200, service=false, done=false }={}) {...}
function hidePitCall()
function updatePitProgress(p)
```
But service persistent should update progress each HUD. We'll manage `pit.bannerLocked`.

At call, random line. On entry and service and complete, use same banner.

Potential issue with setTimeout hiding after service starts; clear timer. We'll define:
```
let pitCallTimer=0;
function setPitBanner(main, sub, opts={}) {
 const {kind=null, ttl=0, progress=null}...
 dom...
 dom.pitCall.classList.toggle('is-service', kind==='service');
 ...
 if (progress!=null) set width; else 0
 clearTimeout(pitCallTimer)
 if (ttl) pitCallTimer=setTimeout(hide,ttl)
}
function hidePitBanner(){...}
```
When service each frame update sub and progress by calling setPitBanner with ttl 0 (no auto-hide). But this clears timer every frame and sets classes. okay. Then on completion set done with ttl 2600, progress 100 maybe.
When call, random; set "call" class no special. Add `race.pit.callText = line.main` maybe HUD.

Need audio radio. Add method in audio.js.

